---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';

const pubDate = new Date('2026-01-18');
---

<Layout
	title="Join our Community"
	description="Sign up for the Decoding The Burn community and stay updated with the latest BMS research and support."
	pubDate={pubDate}
>
	<div class="join-page">
		<p>BMS can be an isolating journey. By joining our community, you'll receive weekly updates on new research, management tips from other patients, and invitations to our support calls.</p>
		
		<div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); padding: 3rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 20px; margin: 3rem 0; display: flex; justify-content: center;">
            <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px;">
                <!-- MailerLite Form -->
                <div class="ml-embedded" data-form="0R4iAA"></div>
            </div>
		</div>

		<div style="margin-top: 4rem;">
			<h2>What you'll get:</h2>
			<ul style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-secondary);">
				<li><strong>Weekly Newsletter</strong>: A curated summary of the latest BMS research and holistic management tips.</li>
				<li><strong>Community Stories</strong>: Real experiences from people like you, sharing what works for them.</li>
				<li><strong>AI Research Updates</strong>: Early access to survey results and data patterns we discover.</li>
				<li><strong>Support Call Invites</strong>: Be the first to know about our monthly community meetups.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

        <p style="margin-top: 4rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; font-style: italic;">
            We respect your privacy. No spam, just support and science. You can unsubscribe at any time.
        </p>
	</div>
</Layout>
